# NDT4 Foundation

When building or reviewing UI for this project, follow the [NDT4 Foundation](https://webtheme.nd.edu/?path=/docs/foundation-about-foundation--docs) design system.

## Required theme assets

Load these (do not use NDT 3.0 paths):

```html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://conductor.nd.edu/stylesheets/themes/ndt/4.0/ndt.css">
<script src="https://conductor.nd.edu/javascripts/themes/ndt/4.0/ndt.js"></script>
```

Optional animations stylesheet (after `ndt.css`):

```html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://conductor.nd.edu/stylesheets/themes/ndt/4.0/animate.css">
```

Fonts are loaded by `ndt.css` from `static.nd.edu` (Garamond Premier Pro + Galaxie Polaris). Do not substitute Inter/Roboto/system stacks for brand UI.

## Prefer theme over custom

- Compose pages with documented NDT classes and CSS variables — do not invent parallel design tokens.
- Brand Blue / Brand Gold are primary; secondary/tertiary colors ≤ ~25% of a page’s color usage.
- Do not alter default theme font colors (accessibility).
- Site-specific CSS belongs in `@layer site` only (see `ndt4-css` rule).
- For detailed class lists and workflows, use the project skill `ndt4-foundation`.

